WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.766
[somber music plays]

00:00:02.791 --> 00:00:04.497
[soft fractured tones play]

00:00:04.497 --> 00:00:06.500
-[Pomni]: A-Are you sure?

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.705
-[Ragatha]: That means...

00:00:07.705 --> 00:00:10.082
♪♪

00:00:10.082 --> 00:00:12.602
Please, just --
-[Jax]: Now we have nothing!

00:00:12.602 --> 00:00:14.291
-[Pomni]: I don't know
what's gonna happen.

00:00:14.316 --> 00:00:17.870
♪♪

00:00:17.905 --> 00:00:19.415
-[Ragatha]: What do we do now?

00:00:19.415 --> 00:00:21.672
-[Pomni]: [tearfully]
I really wanted to help.

00:00:21.672 --> 00:00:27.737
♪♪

00:00:27.737 --> 00:00:28.845
Jax?

00:00:28.845 --> 00:00:32.277
♪♪

00:00:32.277 --> 00:00:35.356
-[Mysterious voice]: Have you...
ever done something

00:00:35.381 --> 00:00:37.201
that you regret?

